<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Bnk of East Asia warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Bnk of East Asia warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it issued 110 million American-style call warrants on Bank of East Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$34.70	  PREMIUM    15.29 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.45	   GEARING    7.55X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     05.DEC.97	 BOARD LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 PAY DATE   25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING DATE   27.FEB.97</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT     CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
